The '''GS-100 salvage ship''' was a salvage [[freighter]], the ship design included multiple arms that could pick up debris from space battles. The [[scavenger]] [[Gha Nachkt]] owned one such ship, the ''[[Vulture's Claw]]'', during the [[Clone Wars]].<ref name="Downfall of a Droid" /> In [[3 ABY]],<ref name="OutlawsDate">{{OutlawsDate}}</ref> a GS-100 was approved to depart from [[Hauler's Keep]] in the [[Khepi system]].<ref name="Outlaws">''[[Star Wars Outlaws]]''</ref>

{{Ship-stub}}

==Behind the scenes==
The ship design first appeared though unnamed in the ''[[Star Wars: The Clone Wars]]'' episode "[[Downfall of a Droid]]" released on [[November 7]], [[2008]].<ref name="Downfall of a Droid" /> It was later identified by the article "Die Wanna Wanga: Encounters of The Twi'lek Kind", written by [[Tim Veekhoven]] and posted on [[StarWars.com]] on [[August 19]], [[2014]].<ref name="Die Wanna Wanga">{{SW|url=news/die-wanna-wanga-encounters-of-the-twilek-kind|text=Die Wanna Wanga: Encounters of The Twi'lek Kind|nolive=1}}</ref>

